      "note": "Master phase 0..1 loops continuously while the auth/welcome panel is visible. It drives the mesh light front (x = -0.2 + 1.4 p), the bar cascade (bar n peaks at p = 0.50 + 0.06 n) and the tagline sweep. Loading state: 4500 ms. Phase is accumulated, so a period change never jumps.",
